Z||000000||Raydar||09-09-2001||01:12 AM||||Gotcha!<P>Sorry. <BR>Actually, it's a 1/18th scale diecast metal model. Manufactured by a company called "Chrono"<BR>I've never heard of the company before, but the car is very detailed. Actually as good as some of the more popular metal models.<BR>Only $10 at Big Lots, of all places.<P>Sorry for the fuzzy pics. Camera doesn't do Macro, well.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Lotus3.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Lotus4.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Lotus5.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Lotus7.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||12
