Z||000002||Raydar||09-09-2001||10:11 AM||||Cool!<BR>Up until yesterday, all I collected were Hot Wheels type stuff and a couple of 1/43 scale models. <BR>The only reason I picked up the Elise is because of the possible reputed connection to a future Fiero. (Reaching a bit, aren't I?) And I've NEVER seen the Elise, or this brand, in any hobby/toy store.<BR>Anyway, now that I've started, it looks like I'll have to pick up that 70 Chevelle SS and AAR 'Cuda, and look around for a Ferrari 360 Modena. And build a waaaayyyy bigger shelf.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 09-09-2001).]||||reg||1
